## Project layout

```text
Phase1/
├── Makefile
├── README.md
├── headers.h          # IPC, Process, clock helpers
├── queue.h            # Linked-list FIFO queue
├── clk.c              # Simulated clock + shared memory
├── process_generator.c
├── scheduler.c
├── process.c
├── test_generator.c
├── processes.txt      # Sample workload
└── keyfile            # Create locally for ftok (not always committed)
```

---

## Tech stack

- **C**, **Linux** system calls  
- **IPC:** message queues, semaphores, shared memory  
- **Data structures:** linked list–backed queue (priority queues / trees can be added for HPF and SRTN)  

